      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "class_f_08_question_02",
      "hash64": "348861EF5E8C2B33",
      "text": "２　藝術家寇沙的代表作是？\\n\\n・挺貼心之向日花怪\\n・放棄了之向日花怪\\n・隨他去之向日花怪",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "class_f_08_ansewer_02a",
      "hash64": "4D3C6AC5380DE329",
      "text": "挺貼心之向日花怪",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "class_f_08_ansewer_02b",
      "hash64": "4D3C67C5380DDE10",
      "text": "放棄了之向日花怪",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "class_f_08_ansewer_02c",
      "hash64": "4D3C68C5380DDFC3",
      "text": "隨他去之向日花怪",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "class_f_08_question_03",
      "hash64": "348860EF5E8C2980",
      "text": "３　帕底亞十景中\\n　　共有幾處瀑布？\\n\\n・２處　・３處\\n・４處",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
