      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "class_f_08_question_04",
      "hash64": "348867EF5E8C3565",
      "text": "４　在帕底亞十景中被稱為\\n　　百萬伏特夜景的是哪個城鎮？\\n\\n・小匙鎮　　　・釀光市\\n・錦匯鎮",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "class_f_08_ansewer_04a",
      "hash64": "4D2846C537FCFCF3",
      "text": "小匙鎮",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "class_f_08_ansewer_04b",
      "hash64": "4D2847C537FCFEA6",
